services and support shall include, but not be limited to, providing support services 
in the following administrative areas:
(1) personnel management services, including equal employment opportunity 
programs;
(2) financial management services;
(3) data processing, including support and services;
(4) library, records, and information services;
(5) office services and operations, including: mail, messenger, printing and 
duplication, graphics, word processing, procurement, and supply services; and
(6) any other administrative support or service which will achieve financial 
